          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="347e-ee4a-764f-6be3">The bearer has a 4+ Invulnerable Save. Each time it passes an Invulnerable Save against a ranged weapon on a 6, the attacking unit suffers a hit at that weapon's Strength and AP.</characteristic>
