      <rules>
        <rule name="Infused Madness" id="3ce3-b450-4de3-5e34" hidden="false">
          <description>May join a unit of Skorpekh Destroyers; that unit adds 1 to its Attacks. At the end of the Assault phase, if the Plasmacyte's unit fought, roll a D6; on a 1, one Destroyer loses one Wound</description>
